      "vision_reason": "This is a terracotta memorial head with elongated neck, elaborate hairstyle, and stylized facial features consistent with Akan (particularly Twifo-Heman/Krobo region) commemorative funerary terracotta heads (mma) used in royal funerary rites in Ghana. The form and material strongly match known Akan terracotta traditions.",
